# scripted live input for a record run (SDL events pushed before HostUpdate v)
# v key <SDLK sym> <mac kVK scancode hex> down|up
# space: skip the intro
250 key 32 31 down
253 key 32 31 up
# mouse wander over the menu
300 motion 200 200 5 3
320 motion 260 230 60 30
340 motion 300 260 40 30
# key 2: Mars in the Sol system
500 key 50 13 down
503 key 50 13 up
# in flight: F-keys and mouse
900 key 282 7a down
903 key 282 7a up
1200 motion 320 240 20 10
1210 button 3 down 320 240
1260 motion 340 250 20 10
1300 button 3 up 340 250
1500 key 283 78 down
1503 key 283 78 up
1800 key 284 63 down
1803 key 284 63 up
2100 key 282 7a down
2103 key 282 7a up
2400 motion 300 200 -40 -50
2600 key 285 76 down
2603 key 285 76 up
2900 button 1 down 300 200
2903 button 1 up 300 200
3100 quit
